# Cursor IDE Rules — Buzz Ecosystem Suite
# Read AGENTS.md for full specification.

- Run `python3 bin/agent-doctor.py --json` to diagnose.
- Run `python3 bin/agent-doctor.py --install` to install.
- Run `python3 bin/agent-doctor.py --verify` to verify.
- Preserve non-invasive architecture and dynamic paths ($HOME / %USERPROFILE%).
- Follow Conventional Commits: feat, fix, docs, chore, test.
